-    <!-- SCRIPTS -->
+    <!-- SCRIPTS
+    ============================================================
+    SCRIPT LOAD ORDER — READ BEFORE MOVING ANYTHING.
+    This project has no module system: every file is global scope,
+    so ORDER IS SEMANTIC. Do not sort alphabetically or "by
+    dependency" blindly — the graph contains deliberate cycles that
+    only work because every cross-file call is deferred (event
+    handlers / runtime calls) or typeof-guarded.
+
+    HARD INVARIANTS (moving these breaks the game SILENTLY):
+    • The old LAST-DECLARED-WINS duplicate functions were consolidated
+      into single implementations in 2026-09 — DO NOT re-declare them
+      elsewhere:
+        _egShowTooltip        -> endgame-currency.js
+        _egRenderCurrencyCell -> endgame-hub-drag-and-drop.js
+        _egGenerateEquipmentDrop -> endgame-equipment-generator.js
+        _egGetElementalDamageBonus -> endgame-combat-calculations.js
+        _egRemoveVeil         -> shared-boss-abilities.js
+        _egPtSegDist          -> shared-boss-abilities.js
+        _shuffleArray         -> class-probabilist.js
+    • boss-framework.js + shared-boss-abilities.js MUST precede
+      every boss-*.js (they Object.assign into EG_BOSS_DEFS /
+      EG_BOSS_MECHANICS at load time).
+    • asset-preload.js → boot-loader.js → main.js is the boot
+      sequence; main.js stays LAST.
+    • Cyclic-by-design clusters (deferred calls only — never
+      reorder files across these boundaries):
+        endgame-encounter.js ↔ bosses/* (typeof-guarded hooks)
+        class-abilities.js ↔ class-*.js
+        screens-map-view.js ↔ screens-level-select.js ↔ screens-world-levels.js
+        achievements.js ↔ achievements-ui.js
+        storyline-engine.js ↔ storyline-beats.js (beats loads LAST on purpose)
+    • The quests-* block MUST load BEFORE state.js: state.js's top-level
+      initState() → migrateOldSave() calls migrateQuestState() at load
+      time. Quest files themselves only touch STATE etc. from deferred
+      calls, so loading them early is safe. (A 2026-09 attempt to move
+      quests after the passive-tree family broke the migration call —
+      do NOT move this block.)
+
+    LOAD-TIME GUARDS:
+    • boot-loader.js runs a sanity check that warns in the console if a
+      script failed to load or was ordered wrong.
+    • boss-rosters.js (last boss file) validates every mechanic handler
+      name via _egValidateAllBossHandlers().
+    • endgame-state.js owns EG_SCREEN_NAV + _egResolveBackFn for the
+      atlas/gate/nexus back-navigation strings.
+
+    CACHE-BUSTING: the ?v= param is per-file; bump it whenever that
+    file's content changes so players don't run stale scripts.
+    ============================================================ -->
